MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: MonsterTips_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ef3bb184878c4254b9ffc2766646f4fc, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 11506634752
    m_Localized: Dracula has a strange allergy to the sun, which ruins his skincare
      routine. Whenever possible, he avoids going out during the day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42880028672
    m_Localized: Due to his financial crisis, Dracula had to find a second job as
      a nurse at a blood bank.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90758008832
    m_Localized: Dracula deals very well with people who are afraid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 116796248064
    m_Localized: Dracula is known for his nocturnal diplomatic parties. He has numerous
      contacts with ambassadors and other important people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151764160512
    m_Localized: Occasionally, the great Count Dracula's empathy is so great that
      he transforms other people into vampires.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 155786498048
    m_Localized: Charismatic and seductive, Dracula always sits at the table with
      the popular girls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 195951153152
    m_Localized: Once, when Dracula was a teenager, he was seen stopping a moving
      car that was about to hit a girl.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 217056890880
    m_Localized: Dracula has been seen sleeping upside down on the roof of his building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 228972908544
    m_Localized: When Dracula feels stressed, he usually goes for a nighttime run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331333226496
    m_Localized: Cuca often sings to calm her friends' fears.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363840
    m_Localized: Sometimes, Cuca feels overwhelmed by the stresses of daily life
      and hides in her underground cave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363841
    m_Localized: In her free time, Cuca gives private lessons in broomstick flying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363842
    m_Localized: Cuca sometimes gets stressed when she needs to talk to her reptilian
      relatives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363843
    m_Localized: Like a good work-from-home employee, Cuca can occasionally conjure
      up an illusion to work in her place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363844
    m_Localized: When Cuca encounters a very big problem, he prepares a damage control
      potion to solve it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363845
    m_Localized: Cuca gets annoyed when Dracula breaks his speed record in his races.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363846
    m_Localized: One of Cuca's potions is known for protecting her friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363847
    m_Localized: Cuca loves going out for a daytime stroll with her friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363848
    m_Localized: Mubis has a habit of sleeping underground, and there are reports
      that it helps with back pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363849
    m_Localized: During his life, Ra would take Amub's for walks on beautiful sunny
      days while they laughed in the faces of mortals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363850
    m_Localized: They say the bandages that hold Amub's remains in place can stretch
      for miles! Besides being extremely durable, they're an excellent alternative
      to toilet paper in emergency situations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363851
    m_Localized: That decomposing puppy face isn't just charming, and let's face
      it, mortals are dying of envy at such beauty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363852
    m_Localized: Amubish has negotiated with pharaohs, gods, and vengeful spirits.
      But, to this day, he hasn't learned how to deal with a mortal asking for a
      discount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363853
    m_Localized: Those who come across this decaying face should be horrified and
      want to keep their distance. But no mortal can resist someone with so much
      gold! (Amubis is not responsible for any possible side effects involving plagues
      and curses)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363854
    m_Localized: After centuries of guarding tombs, Amubis takes protection very
      seriously. So seriously, in fact, that sometimes even the owner can't get into
      his own house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363855
    m_Localized: Amubish is capable of creating illusions so convincing that even
      the gods believe them. Just don't ask why he insists on using his powers to
      make his tomb appear far more luxurious than it actually is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363856
    m_Localized: "Am\xFAbis can move as silently as the dead. It's amazing how nobody
      notices the trail of sand he leaves behind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363857
    m_Localized: Mari Palhacilda always preferred nighttime performances. After all,
      the audience tends to be much more receptive when they can't see clearly what's
      right in front of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363858
    m_Localized: Mari loves to scare people, but she gets deeply offended when someone
      screams upon seeing her. Frankly, she doesn't understand what's so scary about
      a smiling little girl.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363859
    m_Localized: After a minor incident involving her death, Mari developed a rather
      peculiar relationship with blood. Today, she considers any red stain a great
      detail for the costume. She says it adds a special touch to the show!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363860
    m_Localized: Mari was never known for her physical strength. But when someone
      needs a helping hand, she tends to take the expression literally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363861
    m_Localized: Mari can walk through walls and disappear without a trace. Unfortunately,
      the little bells on her clothes don't seem to understand the concept of silence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363862
    m_Localized: Mari is able to disappear and reappear in the blink of an eye. The
      problem is that not all parts of her always reappear at the same time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363863
    m_Localized: Mari always has a smile on her face, regardless of the situation.
      Some say it's friendliness, others find it unsettling. She prefers not to comment,
      especially since taking off the mask is incredibly difficult.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363864
    m_Localized: Mari manages to create such fascinating spectacles that no one notices
      when reality ceases to make sense. Her disappearance acts are especially impressive,
      although she is still learning how to bring all the parts back together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363865
    m_Localized: Mari is extremely sensitive and always cries when other people talk
      about her problems. At least, that's what she says. The tears on her mask were
      already there long before anyone started to open up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363866
    m_Localized: Cyclops loves working during the day. With so much light, he believes
      he can see much better. The city's doors, walls, and lampposts disagree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363867
    m_Localized: Digging tunnels was never a problem for someone that size. We won't
      even discuss how to get him out of there afterwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363868
    m_Localized: Cyclops has a special fondness for animals, and it seems the feeling
      is mutual. He just doesn't understand why the animals get so nervous when he
      tries to pick them up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363869
    m_Localized: They say there's no problem too big for Cyclops' strength. As for
      small problems, well... they usually get even smaller after he tries to help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363870
    m_Localized: At his size, the Cyclops is practically a walking fortress! Just
      make sure you're on the right side when he decides to find a place to sit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363871
    m_Localized: The Cyclops believes that everything can be resolved with a good
      conversation and a friendly smile. Unfortunately, not all humans can remain
      calm in the face of a giant trying to be friendly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363872
    m_Localized: Cyclops has a heart as big as he is! He can't stand to see anyone
      sad and is always ready to offer a tight hug. Sometimes, a little too tight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363873
    m_Localized: Despite his size and strength, Cyclops cannot stand the sight of
      blood. He once fainted upon seeing a small cut on his finger. The real damage
      occurred when he fell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536331379363874
    m_Localized: The Cyclops has never been afraid of heights. After all, he's used
      to seeing the world from up there. His biggest challenge is figuring out exactly
      where to put his feet when he needs to descend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
